# Phase 11 (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.6, 7 criterion 7): Settings > About,
# three dark pages turned with NEXT / PREV (a 190 ms band slide), no wrap,
# and our fourth (Save Diagnostics, release-plan 6.2; its save is
# ipodui-diag-report.script); the wheel and SELECT do nothing on pages
# 1 to 3; MENU returns to Settings.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-about-pages.script
# needs: library
# same: page2 page2_again
# log: about page=1
# log: about page=2
# log: about page=3
# log: about page=4
# golden: skip slide_mid
#
# The counts come from lib_stats() (agent L): before L lands they read 0.
# Serial and model are empty in a fresh config: page 3 shows Version only.

wait 4000            # boot to the main menu
wheel +3             # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT           # About (Settings' first row)
wait 1500
shot page1           # capacity capsule + legend, dots 1 of 3

key RIGHT            # NEXT: page 2
wait 60
shot slide_mid       # (timing) the lower band mid-slide
wait 600
shot page2           # Songs / Videos / Podcasts | Photos / Games / Contacts

wheel +3             # the wheel does nothing
wait 300
key SELECT           # nor does SELECT
wait 300
shot page2_again     # == page2

key RIGHT
wait 700
shot page3           # Serial Number / Model (hidden when empty) / Version
key RIGHT            # page 4 (ours): Save Diagnostics
wait 700
shot page4
key RIGHT            # no wrap: stays on page 4
wait 700
shot page4_end
key LEFT
wait 700
key LEFT
wait 700
key LEFT
wait 700
shot page1_back

key MENU
wait 900
shot settings        # back to Settings, About selected
quit
